{
  "about": "Scene Voice (talk to the animation, blueprint §4.2). Each case: what the student says while an animation is open, and what the player must do. Phase 1 runs these against the player; the bar is ≥ 95% correct and every 'why' answer faithful to the trace. Verbs: pause, play, jump, step, rewind, replay, whatif, why, speed, predict.",
  "cases": [
    { "say": "ruko", "expect": { "verb": "pause" } },
